heij NJA 2016; Kotova YN et al., 2019).<p>This Reactome event shows FXIIIa-mediated cross\u2011linking of fibrin fibers bound to \u03b1IIb\u03b23 (ITGA2B:ITGB3) on the platelet surface.\n", "literatureReference": [9921065, 9921038, 9921036, 9921084, {"dbId": 9921068, "displayName": "Modulation of platelet function through adhesion receptors. A dual role for glycoprotein IIb-IIIa (integrin alpha IIb beta 3) mediated by fibrinogen and glycoprotein Ib-von Willebrand factor", "title": "Modulation of platelet function through adhesion receptors. A dual role for glycoprotein IIb-IIIa (integrin alpha IIb beta 3) mediated by fibrinogen and glycoprotein Ib-von Willebrand factor", "journal": "J Biol Chem", "pages": "11300-6", "pubMedIdentifier": 1597464, "volume": 267, "year": 1992, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/1597464", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, {"dbId": 9921023, "displayName": "Platelet integrins exhibit anisotropic mechanosensing and harness piconewton forces to mediate platelet aggregation", "title": "Platelet integrins exhibit anisotropic mechanosensing and harness piconewton forces to mediate platelet aggregation", "journal": "Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A", "pages": "325-330", "pubMedIdentifier": 29269394, "volume": 115, "year": 2018, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/29269394", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, {"dbId": 9921072, "displayName": "The relative importance of platelet integrins in hemostasis, thrombosis and beyond", "title": "The relative importance of platelet integrins in hemostasis, thrombosis and beyond", "journal": "Haematologica", "pages": "1734-1747", "pubMedIdentifier": 36700400, "volume": 108, "year": 2023, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/36700400", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, {"dbId": 9921062, "displayName": "\u03b1IIb\u03b23 binding to a fibrinogen fragment lacking the \u03b3-chain 